    "name": "SUBJECTS",
    "steam_appid": 3292370,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292370/extras/c92fbe365aa7d30cf8c8abee5c35246d.avif?t=1750699818\" width=800 height=122 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SUBJECTS</strong> is a 4-player co-op survival horror game. You are a Raider, one of the desperate souls outfitted in an Epoch Syndicate suit, tasked with scavenging their supposedly old, abandoned research facilities. It seemed like a straightforward deal: retrieve valuable assets for ES, get paid, and contribute to their &quot;cleanup&quot; efforts. But beneath this fa\u00e7ade lies a horrifying truth: these raids are merely another form of experimentation. The Epoch Syndicate tests your limits, your will, and your humanity, and no one who enters these depths ever truly leaves. Escape is an illusion; survival is your only desperate directive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Deep underground, isolated and disoriented by Syndicate manipulations targeting your very mind, your identity frays as reality blurs. The line between sanity and induced madness thins with every passing moment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292370/extras/c6ae551257eccb4ac285c3b25beb0581.poster.avif?t=1750699818\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292370/extras/c6ae551257eccb4ac285c3b25beb0581.webm?t=1750699818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292370/extras/c6ae551257eccb4ac285c3b25beb0581.mp4?t=1750699818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE SHADOW OF THE EPOCH SYNDICATE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The omnipresent Epoch Syndicate, secretly ruling the world, aims to forcibly evolve humanity through ruthless methods. They cunningly use 'Raiders' like you, equipped with suits and tasks, to clear out their old facilities \u2013 a convenient facade for their relentless, brutal human experimentation, where every Raider is just another unwitting Subject.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292370/extras/402637b2b3ac1bad5fdc2476cb9c2ba3.poster.avif?t=1750699818\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292370/extras/402637b2b3ac1bad5fdc2476cb9c2ba3.webm?t=1750699818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292370/extras/402637b2b3ac1bad5fdc2476cb9c2ba3.mp4?t=1750699818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >THE EVER-SHIFTING PRISON</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each &quot;mission&quot; plunges your team into a new, procedurally generated labyrinth. Fulfill ES-dictated objectives, extract loot for upgrades under their watchful eyes, and survive its hostile entities, power outages, locked doors, and deadly environmental puzzles. This entire &quot;assignment&quot; is a deadly, orchestrated test of your endurance.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292370/extras/39cbc6b0cff1de92fe7bce265ff1fd33.poster.avif?t=1750699818\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292370/extras/39cbc6b0cff1de92fe7bce265ff1fd33.webm?t=1750699818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292370/extras/39cbc6b0cff1de92fe7bce265ff1fd33.mp4?t=1750699818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CAN YOU REMAIN HUMAN?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >ES documents your every struggle as your perception of reality is systematically shattered. Many Raiders have broken before you, their hopes extinguished. Though branded a Subject in their grand, horrifying design, can you defy their control and somehow <strong>still remain human?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292370/extras/c7c6b4958b1bfdaab1501647523542fe.poster.avif?t=1750699818\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292370/extras/c7c6b4958b1bfdaab1501647523542fe.webm?t=1750699818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3292370/extras/c7c6b4958b1bfdaab1501647523542fe.mp4?t=1750699818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Intense 4-Player Co-op Survival:</strong> Team up as Raiders to endure the horrors within ES facilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Procedurally Generated Labyrinths:</strong> Ever-changing layouts for endlessly replayable &quot;missions.&quot;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>ES-Controlled Objectives:</strong> Fulfill tasks, loot, and upgrade \u2013 all part of their sinister experiment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Diverse &amp; Terrifying Threats:</strong> Face unique entities, environmental hazards, and devious puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>Deep, Unsettling Lore &amp; Psychological Horror:</strong> Uncover ES's dark agenda and fight for your sanity.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your sanity frays, your &quot;escape&quot; a Syndicate lie. Welcome to SUBJECTS. The experiment is you.</p>",
